module System

# The crossing from RazorForge's list to Suflae's, written in RazorForge because its receiver is RazorForge's list.
# The other direction, `xs.to[RF::List]()`, is in List.sf.

### Makes a Suflae list of the elements of a list from RazorForge code (a RazorForge library routine's result):
### `rf_list.to[List]()`.
### :returns: A new Suflae list of copies of the elements.
routine List[T].to[SF::System.List[T]]() -> SF::System.List[T]
    var result = SF::System.List[T](capacity: me.count.to[Int]())
    for element in me
        result.add_last(value: element)
    return steal result
